{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:60d7df03e5bb9e74","name":"Hidden Holster","source":{"id":"source:reference-60d7df03e5bb9e74","title":"Hidden Holster","revision":21047,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:03:43Z","sha256":"855f6cfe7ca27be92bfa7236edbb27f70c0d81b22f9cebb5caddadcd438047e3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21047","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hidden%20Holster&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-60d7df03e5bb9e74","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (2 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:e0ba1be2d9a6a37a"}," lack built-in weapons attached directly to the Droids' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendages"},". This attachment gives a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," access to a weapon without having to visibly carry it. Installed in a Droid's leg, the Hidden Holster can hold a weapon one size category smaller than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", or smaller. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can activate the Hidden Holster, which opens up, providing access to the weapon. The Hidden Holster provides the benefit of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quick Draw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quick_Draw","referenceId":"reference:ad3a4bd9344ce557"}," feat with whatever weapon the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is keeping in the Hidden Holster- the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can draw or holster the weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". To gain this benefit, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must have the feat's +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," prerequisite.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
